{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"they are damp and murky, but after a time you see the familiar sight of count kolto \"ah, a familiar face. I was just waking up for an evening stroll, can I help you?\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T04:36:29.872000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868713296809844777","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
